2026-07-30 procs.c Windows Defender warning fix
    Windows Defender was flagging the procs.c code as a trojan due to the
    OpenProcess needing the full PROCESS_QUERY_INFORMATION. This was a false positive, but to
    avoid the warning, switched to using QueryFullProcessImageName instead
    which only require PROCESS_QUERY_LIMITED_INFORMATION. This should avoid
    the false positive warning from Windows Defender.

2026-07-28 Bugfix Clientlog ipconfig
    Long ipconfig /all could take up more than 4kb of the pipe buffer.
    Now reading the pipe while the child process is still producing output,
    instead of waiting for the child process to finish before reading.

2026-07-21 Realese MrBig-0.26.6

2026-07-21 Update Changelog formatting to be more readable and consistent.
    use the ./format-changelog.sh script to format the changelog file.
    this checks for correct date format, and adds a blank line between each
    entry, and ensures the entries are in order of date, with the most recent
    entry at the top.

2026-07-21 Add Clientlog Cpuinfo
    Displays physical and logical core count

2026-07-21 Rename headers in clientlog tcp_connections

2026-07-20 Add Clientlog Registry
    Fetches from configured keys and displays the values.
    Predefined keys are:
    HKLM\SOFTWARE\Axians\SOFTWARE\Axians\ComputerProperties\Customer
    HKLM\SOFTWARE\Axians\SOFTWARE\Axians\ComputerProperties\CI
    HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\Tcpip\Parameters\Domain
    Can be configured via minicfg under [clientlog:registry] section
    Example in mrbig.cfg.dist

2026-07-20 Fix uptime to use same measure as cpu.c
    Uses Pdh to get the boot time instead of GetTickCount64() as it was
    differing from cpu which was more correct.

2026-07-20 Clientlog KB use combination of wmi and registry
    In order to get an accurate list of kbs, both the registry and wmi are
    used to query kbs.
    key searched: HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Uninstall
    HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\WOW6432Node\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Uninstall

2026-07-20 Ntp-skew
    Add new test that checks the system time against a configured NTP
    server and reports the skew in seconds. Also shows recent time change
    events from the event log.

2026-06-30 Clientlog KB use wmi
    To reenable wmi without crashing, it now uses wmi requests to get the KB list.

2026-06-30 Add filtering for external tests based on the test name & path
    This allows to run only a subset of the configured external tests.
    Dissalowing from system folders and users.
    Only allowing files that end with .bat or .cmd.
    Disable with --disable-ext-filters

2026-06-29 Release MrBig-0.26.5

2026-06-23 Increase Uptime & Who int sizes to ULONGLONG
    Changed the Uptime and Who modules to use ULONGLONG instead of DWORD to avoid overflow issues on
    systems that have been up for a long time or have users that have been logged in for a long time.
    This change allows the Uptime and Who modules to handle larger values without overflow.
    Breaks compatability with windows server 2003 and earlier that don't
    support GetTickCount64().

2026-06-22 Add tcp_connections to Clientlog
    Uses netstat to create rows of established tcp connections that can be
    used to create a network map. And a summary of services that
    communicate to and from this node.

2026-02-25 Add timestamp to debuglog messages.
    Extend areana buffer from 512KB to 1MB to accommodate large payload in clientlog.
    Add ubr (Update Build Revision) for clientlog as fourth value.
    Extend payload buffer for certificate in clientlog from 512 to 1024 to accommodate larger payload.
    Release MrBig-0.26.4

2026-02-03 Changed Msgs to default to disabled with opt-in
    seemed to cause crashes when loading in registry.
    enable with option enable_msgs

